              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.1.1+DAN.1.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 1.1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ele rorei eirorie Yeremia oloiboni le Nkai Barak olayioni le Neria, ina kata apa pee eiger ninye kulo rorei tiatua embuku te limunoto e Yeremia, to lari liong'uan le Yehoiakim olayioni le Yosia, olaiguanani le Yuda ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel tialo iyie Barak: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itejo iyie, ‘Woi kewan ai, amu etoponayie Olaitoriani osina le mion ai, atalepori nanu too nkigorot aainei, nematum enkiyeng'iyeng.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji iyie tiaaki ninye, nji ejo Olaitoriani: Ng'ura ina natesheta nanu naa kasulaa, ore ina natuuno nanu naa kadotu taa enkop pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'oru doi iyie ntokitin pooki sapuki tialo kewan ino? Ming'oru iyie ninche; amu ng'ura, kayau nanu entorroni shumata pooki toki naishu naata osesen Olaitoriani ojo: kake ekaaisho nanu iyie enkishooroto o larrabal tiatua iwuejitin pooki neeba anaa nilo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
